{
  "slug": "dailybot",
  "name": "Dailybot",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Dailybot connects Claude Code to your team, helping everyone stay updated as work gets done. It turns meaningful coding progress into clear standup-style updates, so your team can see what changed, what was completed, and why it matters — without manual reporting.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `email` (Send emails to any address via Dailybot), `health` (Announce agent status to Dailybot and receive pending messages), `messages` (Check for pending messages and instructions from your team via Dailybot), `report` (Report work progress to Dailybot), `setup` (Set up the Dailybot plugin — install the CLI, authenticate, and configure the agent profile)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dailybot@claude-community` from `DailyBotHQ/dailybot-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 4
  },
